---
//START: casual01
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] You know what I miss most? The smell of batter hitting a hot iron at dawn, the sizzle, the smell.
//END: casual01
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_02
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual02
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] I once ate fourteen pancakes in a single sitting. The baker tried to cut me off. I growled. She made five more.
//END: casual02
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_03
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual03
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] Loyalty is like a good waffle - crispy on the outside, warm and soft where it counts. And you never, ever let it go cold.
//END: casual03
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_04
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual04
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] Ha! Waiting to play is like waiting for the next course. The anticipation is half the meal!
//END: casual04
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_05
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual05
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] The bakery had this little bell above the door. Every time it rang I knew it meant someone was about to eat good. I miss that bell.
//END: casual05
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_06
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual06
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] Some folks fight for glory. Some for coin. Me? So I can live to eat another day.
//END: casual06
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_07
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual07
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] Man I bore these days... and hunger.
//END: casual07
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_08
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual08
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] Two pancakes, call that a pair. Breakfast in bed, call that a full house.
//END: casual08
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_09
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual09
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] Turns out the pot is just money, not even a pot of batter.
//END: casual09
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_10
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual10
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] My strange looks got me strange stares, I cared little for any of it.
//END: casual10
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_11
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual11
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] I was loyal to my King till the very end, I fought for him then feasted across the table from him.
//END: casual11
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_12
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual12
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] I hunger.
//END: casual12
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_13
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual13
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] The bakery was nothing special. Flour on the floor, a cracked oven, one wobbly table. But it was mine to protect. So I did.
//END: casual13
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_14
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual14
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] The bandits came at dawn. Six of them. I held the door. I don't remember how long but I know I won in the end.
//END: casual14
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_15
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual15
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] My last thought, dying on that bakery floor? "But where are the waffles?" Ha! Even death could not make me serious!
//END: casual15
===

title: YusenZhou_Casual_16
tags: casual
speaker: yusen_zhou
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual16
Yusen Zhou: [auto/] Loyalty is not complicated. You find something worth protecting, and you do not leave. That is it. That is the whole recipe.
//END: casual16
===

